    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli gabiikta ng'eang'da nyaawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, gayghwahidu damanda jea doawa ASEETA fuga sean bea Israeli, nea saawa gayghoah fugeasu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baydeayda NG'UTAMIIDA aba heeda fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyageadayda mida mwadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega was ASEETA Israeli; “Inyas geabiikti danung' ghwanyagaada fuga Israeli Abeeda saawa gaygwarukwiida ng'asheesu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Yuda ea jeeda ng'eanyiidaanyi sean nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaang'eachi, ak ghaang'weardi ak ruweangeasu ea innya aba heedeanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula gayghwahidu eawoojiga gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, jea danyiida ng'eanyiida Israeli ea ng'eanyiida Yuda buuneeda ea diyeanga, gawuurji gidahissideayda siida histeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damanda easikteawi ghaaloati, ak geajakti, ghaarughusti, ak ghaadataschi, ak ghaalaschi uhuuda nyaawa, abeeda gaydabada gideaba gaydang'aapta ak ghaadeaschi, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida ea maygudu gwayi buuneeda:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula, gayghwahidu eawoojiga, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ea dasina neajeedeesh sea fuga Israeli ea fuga Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mawuurji neajeeda ghayi easinyi sea ghweaniga nyaawa, damanda ghayi ang'waanyi saawa ak gearuuni ng'eanyiida Misri, earapeadi datas neajeedeanyu, earapeadi eawooschi siyeeda aba heeda nyaawa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak neajeeni gaydasin sea fuga Israeli, iing'ata eawoojigiga, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, gaydayiin diigheandeanyu jeenyaawa ea jeeda gurooruunatka nyaawa, gaydang'waar ak gaydoaw ASEETA nyaawa, nea saawa gayghoah fugeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea manda siida jea ghoanaal giischeewoocheandaanyi, ghana orjeeda ghaamwat, nea gwayeesha, ‘nala NG'UTAMIIDA,’ aba gideaba gayghwanalan sean, ghang'eada dea mwanang'eawa saawa aba jeenyaawa, Ea ghoah dea haweewa saawa aba jeenyaawa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba gaydasamsa giidiinyeanyeeka nyaawa, nea maygudu daapkaat riing'eega nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula, ghwahidu askwearjoojiga gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, gajeadeas mujiineani aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghang'eada madalooda Hananeli ea gagul ghwanooda dooshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mareamarooda siiteeniida gaygawa mwadi ea ghwahita heayeeda Garebu, ak gayghaghwan geaw ea ghwahita Goa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea moangoachiyda sean bea muscheeka ea deareeda ea madameega sean ea ghwahita ghealooda Gidroni nea gagul ghwanooda dooshta faraasi, mida meatkweeda ghayeawa, gayghoah heeda ghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA mwajealoata nea majeenyarja damanda manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
